# Open Source

Assume this project will be publicly released.

Do not:
- commit secrets
- hardcode local filesystem paths
- depend on private infrastructure
- require cloud services for core functionality
- introduce telemetry without explicit opt-in

Prefer local-first functionality.

Configuration should have sensible defaults.

New features should work without requiring accounts or external services whenever possible.

Keep public APIs and domain types documented and stable.